=== commit e3c38597f8b2c0aaf796b79a37d04fe29bf2cfbd
p4_health: a stop signal during a teardown ends the run
The teardown handler kept the cleanup going but threw the signal away, so a stop during ndt down let the next bring-up claim the lab. The first signal is now kept and recorded on the round once its cleanup is done, and the docstring says what the handler does.


